What is Video Content Analytics?
Video Content Analytics (VCA) is a suite of AI powered solutions that transform raw video feeds into structured, actionable data. By deploying algorithms that recognize objects, track movements, and infer human behaviours, VCA systems enable real time surveillance, operational optimisation, and incident response across a wide array of industries. This approach not only replaces manual monitoring but also enhances safety, drives efficiency, and unlocks new revenue opportunities for enterprises within the visual intelligence ecosystem.
